{"id":"b4594163bf46851f","group":"56","path":"56/56-lem-proper-left-pattern-parallel-preservation.md","title":"真左部模式的平行保持","display":"lem-proper-left-pattern-parallel-preservation — 真左部模式的平行保持","type":"lemma","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"lemma","label":"56-lem-proper-left-pattern-parallel-preservation","aliases":["56-lem-proper-left-pattern-parallel-preservation"],"display":"lem-proper-left-pattern-parallel-preservation — 真左部模式的平行保持","depends_on":["[[56-df-orthogonal]]","[[56-df-subterm]]","[[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]","[[56-df-substitution-application]]","[[56-df-variables]]"],"source_section":"§4.7 Lemma 4.7.7","source_printed_pages":"122","source_ocr_blocks":[143],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"label","html":"56-lem-proper-left-pattern-parallel-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-lem-proper-left-pattern-parallel-preservation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-proper-left-pattern-parallel-preservation — 真左部模式的平行保持"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1f468692d9334725\" href=\"?note=1f468692d9334725\" title=\"56-df-parallel-rewrite\">56-df-parallel-rewrite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.7 Lemma 4.7.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"122"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>143</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(l,r)\\in R\">\\((l,r)\\in R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\lhd l\">\\(s\\lhd l\\)</span> 为左部的真子项，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in T\">\\(t\\in T\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_R\">\\(\\Rightarrow_R\\)</span>、替换应用和变量集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1f468692d9334725\" href=\"?note=1f468692d9334725\" title=\"56-df-parallel-rewrite\">56-df-parallel-rewrite</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\sigma\\Rightarrow_R t\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\\;\n\\left(t=s\\tau\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{Var}(s)\\;x\\sigma\\Rightarrow_R x\\tau\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\sigma\\Rightarrow_R t\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\\;\n\\left(t=s\\tau\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{Var}(s)\\;x\\sigma\\Rightarrow_R x\\tau\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按真左部子项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 的结构归纳。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=x\">\\(s=x\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(x)=t\">\\(\\tau(x)=t\\)</span>，其余变量任取恒等。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=f(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)\">\\(s=f(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)\\)</span>，平行位置见证不可能含根：否则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 与某规则左部有共同实例，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\">\\(l\\)</span> 的该非变量真位置产生重叠，违背正交性。故位置见证按函数儿子分解，各归纳结果给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_i\">\\(\\tau_i\\)</span>。左线性保证不同 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_i\">\\(s_i\\)</span> 的变量集互不相交，故可把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_i\">\\(\\tau_i\\)</span> 在这些变量上的限制合并，其他变量取恒等。所得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 满足目标和每变量的平行步。常元分支取空见证。</p>\n<p>“真子项”不可放宽为左部自身：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=l\">\\(s=l\\)</span>，根规则收缩一般改变模式。本引理只描述保持左部真模式的子归约；根 redex 的收缩在平行移动命题中单独处理。变量取值变化可以产生新的 redex，但不能破坏外围左部模式。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese (2003), Lemma 4.7.7；已读并重建其归纳证明，显式保留非根模式与左线性合并条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-orthogonal","status":"resolved","id":"34fb9d07dfbad48c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-orthogonal]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-subterm]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-parallel-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"1f468692d9334725","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-variables","status":"resolved","id":"491e726b9c1f42b0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-variables]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-orthogonal","status":"resolved","id":"34fb9d07dfbad48c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$ 且 $\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，见 [[56-df-orthogonal]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(l,r)\\in R$，$s\\lhd l$ 为左部的真子项，见 [[56-df-subterm]]；$\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)$，$t\\in T$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-parallel-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"1f468692d9334725","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Rightarrow_R$、替换应用和变量集见 [[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]、[[56-df-substitution-application]]、[[56-df-variables]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Rightarrow_R$、替换应用和变量集见 [[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]、[[56-df-substitution-application]]、[[56-df-variables]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-variables","status":"resolved","id":"491e726b9c1f42b0","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Rightarrow_R$、替换应用和变量集见 [[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]、[[56-df-substitution-application]]、[[56-df-variables]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"(l,r)\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"s\\lhd l","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_R","display":false},{"tex":"s\\sigma\\Rightarrow_R t\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\\;\n\\left(t=s\\tau\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{Var}(s)\\;x\\sigma\\Rightarrow_R x\\tau\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"s=x","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(x)=t","display":false},{"tex":"s=f(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"l","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_i","display":false},{"tex":"s_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"s=l","display":false}],"bytes":2338,"backlinks":[{"id":"cdd1f74aa0c940f7","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s,t,w\\in T$；平行替换相容性与真左部模式保持分别见 [[56-lem-parallel-substitution]]、[[56-lem-proper-left-pattern-parallel-preservation]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-lem-proper-left-pattern-parallel-preserv